## Attribution

This library is released under the MIT License. It does not include text from
third-party game books.

### D&D 5th Edition

Dice and actor helpers in this library are inspired by common 5e conventions
(polyhedral dice, advantage/disadvantage, named modifiers). The library does
not ship System Reference Document (SRD) text. The SRD is published by
Wizards of the Coast LLC under CC BY 4.0:
https://dnd.wizards.com/resources/systems-reference-document

### Call of Cthulhu

Call of Cthulhu® is a registered trademark of Chaosium Inc.

This library implements compatible d100 roll-under mechanics (including
bonus/penalty tens dice). It does not include copyrighted content from
Call of Cthulhu sourcebooks.
